     "at": 7.0,
     "text": "One pin of a microcontroller often speaks several protocols. On this R P 23 50, one pin sends pulses in one protocol, a fast digital stream in another, and in a third it talks both ways over a single wire. That third protocol seems to need a resistor the other two cannot live with."
    }
