     "at": 19.71,
     "text": "A bit lasts 8.68 microseconds, and the pad samples every 1.09 microseconds: 8 samples to a bit."
    },
    {
     "at": 27.65,
     "text": "The decoder takes the samples as an inverted serial byte and reads the middle of each bit. It hands on the same bytes a pull-up would have given."
    }
