     "at": 9.92,
     "text": "With the pull-up resistor fitted, request and answer are plain levels: 5 bytes out and, 6.4 milliseconds later, 8 bytes back."
    },
    {
     "at": 20.08,
     "text": "Without the resistor, and without precharge, the wire never moves. No answer can be read."
    },
    {
     "at": 27.57,
     "text": "With precharge, the answer is there, as a train of pulses."
    },
